conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level.", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"content": "engenn8le18ob07re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Modals for Possibility and Necessity", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use modals when you want to express possibility and necessity.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">You use <span class=\"italic\">may</span>, <span class=\"italic\">might</span> and <span class=\"italic\">could</span> to express possibility in the past and in the future.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "*<span class=\"italic\">Might </span>suggests that something is less possible than <span class=\"italic\">may</span>.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<ul><li><span class=\"italic\">might </span>/ <span class=\"italic\">might not</span> + infinitive</li><li><span class=\"italic\">could </span>/ <span class=\"italic\">could not</span> + infinitive</li><li><span class=\"italic\">may </span>/ <span class=\"italic\">may not</span> + infinitive</li></ul>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Expressing Necessity</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "You use <span class=\"italic\">must </span>or <span class=\"italic\">have to</span> to express that something is necessarily true. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Example:<br/><span class=\"italic\">I have to bite the bullet and commit to this.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I might take a chance and register for the floristry course at the college.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "You could be right.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "You might feel more self-assured.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "I have to bite the bullet and commit to this.", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "<span class=\"italic\">Be Supposed To </span>", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use the structure <span class=\"italic\">be supposed to</span> when you want to talk about expectations, obligations or arrangements.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "You can use <span class=\"italic\">be supposed to</span> to talk about situations in the past, present or future.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "The structure is:<br/>Subject + To be + <span class=\"italic\">supposed to</span> + verb", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Present:<span class=\"italic\"> I am supposed to register for the course today.</span> <br/>Past: <span class=\"italic\">I was supposed to register for the course yesterday.</span><br/> Future: <span class=\"italic\">I am supposed to register for the course tomorrow.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "**Pronunciation tip**:<br/>When you say be supposed to, you link the /d/ and /t/ sounds together. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Like this: <br/>Be suppose_to", "type": "text"}, {"content": "The course is supposed to start in two weeks so I must register this week.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "You're supposed to be a bit nervous when you make a big change.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "That's what friends are supposed to do!", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to waver", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to show doubt or indecision ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I want to know if you already solved your dilemma or if you are still wavering.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le18ob07aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": "These are words you use to talk about decision-making and social activities.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to resolve", "type": "name"}, {"content": " to come to a definite decision about something", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I'm calling to see if you have resolved your dilemma.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le18ob07aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to take a chance", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to take a risk hoping something good will come ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I think I might take a chance and register for the floristry course at the college.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le18ob07aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to bite the bullet", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to accept something difficult and commit to it", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I have to bite the bullet and commit to this.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le18ob07aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to venture", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to take a risk without knowing the outcome", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: You have to be really proud that you're venturing into this.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le18ob07aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "intimidated ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to feel fear or timid towards something or someone", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I feel excited but also a little intimidated.  ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le18ob07aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "self-assured", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to feel confident in yourself", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I think that once you meet some people and make some friends in the class you might feel more self-assured.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le18ob07aud07", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to be on the fence", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to be undecided between two options ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I was on the fence for a while, but I think I might take a chance now. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le18ob07aud08", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to get up to", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to do something, like a  plan or activity that is usually done during free time", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Now let's talk about what we can get up to this weekend! Let's do something fun!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le18ob07aud09", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "I talk about activities and decision-making.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I speculate about things, people and events.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I make a list of adjectives to describe personality.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I write a letter to thank a friend.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Think about what is important to you in a friend.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Make a list of adjectives to describe the behavior of a good friend.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Imagine that a friend has helped you to make an important decision.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write a letter to your friend thanking them for being such a good friend. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Use at least 6 adjectives from your list to describe your friend and include examples of these qualities.", "type": "text"}]}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "id": 0}, {"template_override": 1, "type": "audio", "title": "", "_data": [], "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn8le18ob07re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn8le18ob07re2img05.jpg", "images": [{"image": "engenn8le18ob07re2img01.jpg", "text": "", "time": "0", "id": 0}, {"image": "engenn8le18ob07re2img01.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Hello?\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Hi Sally! I'm calling to see if you have resolved your dilemma or if you are still wavering.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Well, I was on the fence for a while, but I think I might take a chance and register for the floristry course at the college.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Wow! Have you made your final decision?\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Yes, I have to bite the bullet and commit to this. The course is supposed to start in two weeks so I must register this week.", "time": "100", "id": 1}, {"image": "engenn8le18ob07re2img05.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Congratulations! That's very exciting! You have to be really proud that you're venturing into this.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Yes, I am but I'm also a little intimidated.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: You're supposed to be a bit nervous when you make a big change. That's normal. I think that once you meet some people and make some friends in the class you might feel more self-assured.", "time": "22500", "id": 2}, {"image": "engenn8le18ob07re2img02.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: You could be right. You must be tired of listening to me talk about this! I really appreciate all the support you've given me.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: That's what friends are supposed to do! I'm sure that you would do the same for me.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Of course! You must know that you can talk to me about anything in your life and I'll be here for you.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Thanks Sally! Now let's talk about what we can get up to this weekend! Let's do something fun!", "time": "42000", "id": 3}]}}